  m_text: 'You''re in debt to a Yakuza organization.


    You really, really don''t
    want to be.


    Click and drag to scoop ice cream and serve it to customers
    to make money.


    Ensure you get their orders correct - they won''t take it
    if it''s wrong!


    Complete as many orders as you can before the day is done.
    Just ensure you can pay your rent on time. If you go broke, the game will end.'
